+{"$schema":"fabro-journal-v1","run_id":"01M1S6VRWQMD56M1X8HWAXDSNN","node":"planner","visit":1,"status":"succeeded","ts":"2026-09-05T16:41:42Z","data":{"painpoints":[{"text":"Run-container mise config is untrusted, so the first `sd ready` call failed with 'Config files in /repos/denkhaus/fabro/.mise.toml are not trusted' and the planner burned a tool call on `mise trust` before any tracker read worked (this run, 01M1S6VRWQMD56M1X8HWAXDSNN). Already tracked as seed fabro-66db 'sandbox: pre-trust the repo mise config in run containers' — the pain recurred here, which strengthens its case."}],"observations":["Tracker holds 126 ready seeds; `sd ready --limit 200` put fabro-78ac first among High — picked it after verifying its basis is live (create-then-start `?` at lib/components/fabro-tool/src/create.rs:453-464) rather than stale.","Resolved a spec ambiguity in the brief: the seed's 'created <id>, start blocked: ...' example reads like summary text but the real fix belongs in the structured CreatedRunResult (additive JsonSchema field preferred); documented that post-failure run state is unknown, so the error must be reported verbatim, not mapped to 'pending'."]}}
